cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "COI taxonomic assignment with cross-filled reference databases"
abstract: >-
  Taxonomic assignment of COI amplicon sequence variants (ASVs) against three cross-filled reference
  databases (MIDORI2, BOLDistilled, MetaZooGene) with three classifiers (BLASTn, SINTAX in VSEARCH,
  RDP naive Bayesian classifier). Animal species (excluding arachnids and insects) present in one
  database but absent from another are copied into the database that lacks them, and all records are
  given seven-rank lineages (kingdom to species).
